    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:</i>&nbsp;<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><b>Manufactured By:</b> N/A </p><p><b>Applicable To:</b> Any Armor that provides an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> </p><p>Environmental Bastion Armors are designed to protect the wearer from harsh environments- including <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vacuum\" title=\"Vacuum\">Vacuum</a>- and provide a comfortable environment for whatever <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species\" title=\"Species\">Species</a> they are made for (for example, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ubese\" title=\"Ubese\">Ubese</a> wear Environmental Bastion Armor that produces atmosphere similar to their homeworld's). </p><p><b>Armor:</b> Environmental Bastion Armor acts as a sealed <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Space_Suit\" title=\"Space Suit\">Space Suit</a>, providing a number of hours of breathable air to the wielder equal to the armor's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a>. </p>",
